OL,3,GNEWSALetting agent accused of not
OL,4,Areturning deposits to more than 100
OL,5,Atenants
OL,6,
OL,7,FA letting agent has been accused of not
OL,8,Freturning the deposits of more than 100
OL,9,Ftenants.
OL,11,FTony Singh, whose company Morgan, Payne
OL,12,F& Knightly has multiple branches in
OL,13,FBirmingham, Telford and Wolverhampton,
OL,14,Falso faces accusations from landlords,
OL,15,Fwho say he did not pass rent on to
OL,16,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
