OL,3,GNEWSALetting agent accused of not
OL,4,Areturning deposits to more than 100
OL,5,Atenants
OL,6,
OL,7,FUnpaid sums have in a handful of cases
OL,8,Fseen county court judgments made
OL,9,Fagainst both the company and Singh -
OL,10,Fwho goes by Tony, but whose full name
OL,11,Fis Amun Singh Judge. Each has also been
OL,12,Freported to Trading Standards.
OL,14,FA BBC investigation can now shine more
OL,15,Flight on the scale of money owed,
OL,16,Funcovering evidence that tenants and
OL,17,Flandlords are between them out of
OL,18,Fpocket by hundreds of thousands of
OL,19,Fpounds. Some fear they will never see
OL,20,Ftheir money.
